        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Steyr M1912, Roth–Steyr M1907\n- Companies: Steyr Mannlicher\n- People: Karel Krnka\n- Places: Sankt Ulrich bei Steyr, Austria\n- Concepts: semi-automatic pistol, firearm mechanism\n\nFacts:\n- In 1911, Steyr Mannlicher developed the Steyr M1912 semi-automatic pistol.\n- Karel Krnka designed the Steyr M1912.\n- The Steyr M1912 is also known as the Steyr-Hahn.\n- The Steyr M1912 was based on the mechanism of the Roth–Steyr M1907.\n- Steyr Mannlicher is a firearms manufacturer based in Sankt Ulrich bei Steyr, Austria.",
